  "details": "As it is now, when avatar personal space is on, it does not make you vanish for them. \n\nIf I have it on I want them to vanish for me AND and I also want me to vanish for them if they get too close. This way there is a clear implied indicator of \"hey respect privacy\" before having to get confrontational about it (which feeds their crave for attention.) \n\nA lot of nuisance users like getting up close and recording your reaction when they are being annoying for ytube clout (including inappropriate behaviors)  This would help curve that bad behavior. \n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.",
